plugins/nusaw - notices for the NUSAW package (nusaw.supersaw, nusaw.a64.rmp)

NUSAW's DSP is NuSaw's engine (src/dsp/nusaw_engine.cpp), ported to C for one voice a state and adapted for the
Sidecar (nusaw.c's header lists the changes: mono, block-rate coefficients, Q capped at 12, a click-free retrigger).
